            "review_title": "Review at Sosohan Galbi Da Nang",
            "review_text": "조니\nDa Nang, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nBeef ribs number one in Da Nang\nJun 2026 • Family\nI recently had the chance to eat at Sosohan Galbi Da Nang and I was very satisfied. Delicious grilled meat, especially the beef ribs and meat marinated to perfection, grilled until fragrant and tender. The side dishes are also quite diverse and suit the taste.\n\nThe restaurant space is clean and cozy, and the staff are enthusiastic and cute. The dish arrived quite fast, and the food quality is good for the price.\n\nIf you like Korean BBQ in Da Nang, I think this is a place worth trying. If I have the chance, I will come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 21, 2026",
